  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Urban Development Technical Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GGGI is invited to join consortium led by DAI (with ICLEI) for EU tender by INTPA.TheEU Urban Development Technical Facilitywill becovering all the countries where INTPA is active. Requests will come both from EU Delegations and from INTPA HQ and will be demand driven. The contractor will have to deliver high level technical assistance and policy advice at country, regional and global level through expert advice and field missions in order to support committed countries and partners to reach the SDG11 objectives.&amp;middot; Duration: 48 months&amp;middot; Budget: approx. EUR 10M. Subsequent to the initial contract resulting from this tender, new services consisting in the repetition of similar services up to the estimated amount of EUR 10 M, may be entrusted to the initial contractor by negotiated procedure without prior.&amp;middot; Tender Process: restricted, ie. the EU will select 4-8 entities to submit tender in March 2022 or so.</narrative>
  </description>
